.TH MILLENNIUM\-INJECTION 1 "August 7, 2026" "millennium-helpers" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
millennium-injection \- temporarily disable or enable Millennium Steam injection
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B millennium injection
\fICOMMAND\fR [\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Controls only Millennium's bootstrap injection. Disabling preserves the
installed client, configuration, plugins, and themes so injection can be
re-enabled later. Restart Steam after changing injection state.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B status
Report whether all detected bootstrap hooks are enabled, disabled, or partial.
.TP
.B disable
Preserve and deactivate the Millennium bootstrap hooks.
.TP
.B enable
Restore previously disabled bootstrap hooks.
.SH OPTIONS
.\" @@cli-contract:commands.injection.man_options@@
.TP
.BR \-y ", " \-\-yes
Skip confirmation when disabling injection.
.TP
.BR \-d ", " \-\-dry\-run
Show the bootstrap changes without modifying files.
.TP
.BR \-q ", " \-\-quiet
Suppress informational output.
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
Show version information.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show help message.
.\" @@/cli-contract:commands.injection.man_options@@
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B millennium injection status
.TP
.B millennium injection disable --dry-run
.TP
.B millennium injection disable --yes
.TP
.B millennium injection enable
.SH NOTES
On Linux, the bootstrap symlinks are preserved with a
.B .millennium-disabled
suffix. On Windows, the same suffix is applied to
.BR wsock32.dll .
These helpers do not install a Millennium bootstrap hook on macOS.
